---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import releaseIcon from '../assets/projects/Cities_Skylines_1_Automated_Public_Transport_Vehicle_Management_Release_Version.webp';
import developmentIcon from '../assets/projects/Cities_Skylines_1_Automated_Public_Transport_Vehicle_Management_Development_Version.webp';
const editions = [{ label: 'Release', icon: releaseIcon }, { label: 'Development', icon: developmentIcon }];
---

<!-- Author: OpenAI-Codex_Responsible: Modpack_Website. -->
<section class="section" lang="en" aria-labelledby="planned-vehicle-management">
	<div class="page-wrap">
		<div class="section-heading">
			<div><p class="eyebrow">Planned project</p><h2 id="planned-vehicle-management">Automated Public Transport Vehicle Management</h2></div>
		</div>
		<p>In planning. These approved icons show the intended Release and Development editions. No DLL download or Steam Workshop item is available yet.</p>
		<div class="planned-icons">
			{editions.map(({ label, icon }) => <figure><Image src={icon} alt={'Automated Public Transport Vehicle Management ' + label + ' edition icon'} widths={[320, 640]} sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 320px" format="webp" quality={90} /><figcaption>{label} edition · planned</figcaption></figure>)}
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.planned-icons { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 320px)); gap: 24px; margin-top: 24px; }
	figure { min-width: 0; }
	img { width: 100%; height: auto; }
	figcaption { margin-top: 8px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
	@media (max-width: 640px) { .planned-icons { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 320px); } }
</style>
